direction: down
classify: "Scheme completion / caller classification\nactual branch, object/slot kind and effect\nprivate init / published store / structural transfer"
prepare: "Prepare with protected inputs\nreserve log/access capacity\nslow path may collect: reload afterward"
commit: "No-safepoint commit\nvalidate owner/layout/epoch\nremember young source + major obligations\nqualified store / publication"
classify -> prepare
prepare -> commit
active: "Active dirty/root/capture producer epoch\nsource storage remains retained"
commit -> active
cut: "Freeze and acknowledge collection cut\nall actual producers and relevant readers"
active -> cut
drain: "Drain frozen sources and root/capture work\ntrace/fix all young references\naccount in-flight workers and publication debt"
cut -> drain
close: "Closure before storage reuse\nsettle source leases / root withdrawals\nreset only the completed epoch"
drain -> close
next: "Next active epoch\nnew writes remain recorded\nno reset may erase them"
close -> next
gap: "Missing writer, raw native root or invalid source\nuse a sufficient admitted fallback\nor keep generational profile unresolved"
classify -> gap
cut -> gap
